---
import Map from "../images/Localization.svg";
import Point from "../images/Map.svg";
---

<section id="Localization" class="flex flex-col items-center p-10 h-fit w-full lg:h-[75dvh]">
  <h2 class="text-secondary">Localization</h2>
  <div class="flex flex-col-reverse lg:flex-row gap-2 items-center ">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center lg:w-1/2 gap-3 text-white">
      <p>
        <span class="text-secondary font-bold italic">Providenciales</span> — often
        referred to as <span class="text-secondary font-bold italic"
          >“Provo”</span
        > — is world-renowned for its award-winning beaches, including Grace Bay Beach,
        celebrated for its powder-soft white sand and crystal-clear turquoise waters.
        <span class="text-secondary font-bold italic"
          >The island is known for its sophisticated yet relaxed atmosphere,
          blending luxury living with untouched natural beauty.</span
        >
      </p>
      <p>
        Boating enthusiasts will appreciate the island’s exceptional boating
        culture, with calm turquoise waters, hidden cays, vibrant coral reefs,
        and easy access to some of the Caribbean’s most breathtaking
        destinations. From sunset cruises and fishing excursions to
        island-hopping adventures, the surrounding waters are truly part of the
        lifestyle.
      </p>
      <p>
        Beyond Providenciales, the stunning sister islands of North Caicos,
        Middle Caicos, and South Caicos offer endless opportunities to explore
        secluded beaches, dramatic coastlines, authentic island culture, and
        unforgettable natural scenery. <br />
        This home is more than a residence — <span
          class="text-secondary font-bold italic"
          >it is a private island sanctuary designed for those seeking luxury,
          tranquility, and the unmatched beauty of Turks and Caicos living.</span
        >
      </p>
    </div>
    <a class="group relative w-full h-[50dvh] lg:w-1/2 lg:h-full overflow-hidden " href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/1ZSGmQHLDs54siTz8">
      <Map class="w-full h-full text-secondary stroke-secondary stroke-4 hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-300"/>
      <Point class="absolute top-[58%] left-[50%] md:top-[70%] md:left-[52%] lg:top-[68%] xl:top-[70%] h-4 w-4 xl:h-6 xl:w-6 text-accent"/>
      <p class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 animate-pulse border-2 p-1 rounded-sm text-secondary">Click to view on google maps</p>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>